by the @fontsource packages. The fonts are licensed under the SIL Open Font
License, Version 1.1 (OFL-1.1).

ElecKoi Desktop uses Font Awesome Free SVG icon data. The free icon data is
licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0), and
the Font Awesome code is licensed under the MIT License.

The exact package versions, attributions and supplied license texts for these
fonts and icons are retained in resources/licenses/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt.
Font-family names such as Segoe UI, Microsoft YaHei, Consolas, Cascadia Code and
SFMono-Regular are operating-system font fallbacks only; their font files are
not distributed by this repository or its Windows package.
